{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>It is what HaShem spoke.</b> That which He said above: 'and it shall be on the sixth day, and they shall prepare what they bring.'" "<b>And all the surplus.</b> That which is left over beyond what is fitting for two meals, of the morning and of the evening, of the sixth day — you shall leave it kept until the morning of the Sabbath. By decree of the King it will not spoil, and the same applies to the meal at the conclusion of the Sabbath."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:13.794235280Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}